# AI Agent Project Summary — Intent-Aware (Autonomous QA + Security Tester)

## Project Overview
Point it at a live app (just a URL — spec/description/credentials optional) and it explores like a QA
engineer, attacks like a pentester, and returns a founder-grade report. The LLM (local Claude Code CLI)
is the **brain**; deterministic plugins with **effect oracles** are the **hands**. Read-only and
host-scoped by default, so it's safe against third-party targets.

## Live architecture (v2.1 — what actually runs)
- **Orchestrator:** `agent/engine.py` — discover → plan (LLM) → attack matrix → explain (LLM) → report.
- **Brain:** `agent/llm.py` (Claude Code CLI, no API key) + `agent/planner.py`; untrusted app text is
  fenced by `agent/prompt_safety.py` (prompt-injection defence); temperature 0; request + LLM-call budgets.
- **Discovery:** `core/surface.py` (OpenAPI v2/v3, basePath, servers) + `extractors/parser.py`
  (auto-probe, JSON/YAML, scope-safe) + GraphQL detection + UI shadow spec (first-class endpoints).
- **Identities:** `core/auth_adapters.py` — `form`/`bearer`/`api_key`/`header`/`session`/`token_exchange`
  (non-form resolve without a browser); `core/discovery.py` harvests owned + foreign ids.
- **Attacks:** `attacks/` — 16 plugins, each an effect oracle (broken_auth, idor, mass_assignment, sqli,
  xss, stored_xss, path_traversal, authz_matrix, jwt_attacks, graphql, web_extra = cors/security_headers/
  open_redirect/ssti/command_injection/secrets_exposure).
- **QA crawler:** `qa/` — auth-aware, SPA-hardened (networkidle, robust selectors, button/JS nav).
- **Report:** `reports/founder_report.py` — A–F grade (confidence-weighted, coverage-gated), plain-language
  explain (`detection/explainer.py`), repro curl (incl. baseline for differentials), per-job artifacts.
- **API:** `api/main.py` (`/analyze`, `/status/{id}`, resume by job id).

## Legacy v1 (kept only for reference — do NOT build on)
`agent/loop.py`, `agent/state_graph.py`, `detection/layer1|2|3*.py`, `execution/crawler.py`,
`execution/runner.py`, `extractors/intent.py`, `extractors/assumptions.py`, `reports/generator.py`.

## How to run / verify
- Regression gate (no LLM, no browser): `./.venv/bin/python -m pytest tests/test_v2_engine.py`
  → 13 tests, 16 detectors catch their planted bug in `target_app`, **zero false positives**.
- Full demo: `./.venv/bin/python run_demo.py` → see `latest_report.md`.
- Safety: write-based probes need `allow_writes=True` (disposable/staging only); DELETE never injected.

